<%- include('../partials/header') %>

<div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16">
  <div class="text-center space-y-4 mb-16">
    <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-emerald-700">Circular Thrift Movement in India</span>
    <h1 class="font-display text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold text-gray-900">Rethinking Indian Wardrobes</h1>
    <p class="text-base text-gray-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
      Styleswap connects thrifters, streetwear collectors, and conscious shoppers across Bengaluru, Mumbai, Delhi, and pan-India to buy, sell, and swap second-hand fashion in Indian Rupees (₹).
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="space-y-12 bg-white rounded-3xl p-8 sm:p-12 border border-gray-200 shadow-sm text-gray-700 leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-base">
    
    <div>
      <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3 flex items-center gap-2">
        <i data-lucide="sparkles" class="w-5 h-5 text-amber-500"></i>
        Our Mission: Affordable, Zero-Waste Fashion for India
      </h2>
      <p>
        Millions of quality garments — from vintage Levi's denim to oversized college hoodies and sneaker grails — sit unworn in closets. Styleswap provides an authentic, fair marketplace where pre-loved western apparel finds a new home through direct purchases in Indian Rupees (₹) and cashless item-for-item trades.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6 pt-4">
      <div class="bg-gray-50 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-gray-200">
        <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2 flex items-center gap-2">
          <i data-lucide="repeat" class="w-4 h-4 text-indigo-600"></i>
          Cashless Wardrobe Swaps
        </h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">
          Want a vintage leather jacket or retro sneakers without spending money? Our barter system lets you propose a direct swap using pieces from your own closet.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-emerald-50/60 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-emerald-200">
        <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2 flex items-center gap-2">
          <i data-lucide="shield-check" class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600"></i>
          Transparent Second-Hand Standards
        </h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">
          From "Like New (Barely Worn)" to "Thrifted / Vintage Fade", our condition criteria ensure honest listings and trustworthy trades.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div id="trade-guide" class="pt-6 border-t border-gray-100">
      <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">Item Barter & Shipping Guidelines</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-600">
        <li>Members with at least one active listing in their closet can propose swaps.</li>
        <li>The recipient has complete freedom to accept or decline any trade proposal.</li>
        <li>Once confirmed, both items automatically transition to "Swapped / Exchanged" status.</li>
        <li>Ship items with valid domestic tracking numbers (Delhivery, Blue Dart, India Post).</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

  </div>
</div>

<%- include('../partials/footer') %>
